o mx-auto" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> <div class="absolute z-0" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> <img src="./carrinho_files/ai-bg.D0vhfi6c.png" alt="" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> <img src="./carrinho_files/ai-bg.D0vhfi6c.png" alt="" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> </div> <div class="relative z-1" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> <div class="flex justify-center items-center max-w-full lg:max-w-300 w-full lg:flex-row-reverse justify-between flex-col content-wrapper"> <div class="lg:w-40% w-full md:text-left text-center  lg:max-w-105"> <h3 class="font-600! lg:text-7 lg:leading-normal text-2xl"><span class="text-theme">Melhor Removedor de Fundo</span> para Vender Online</h3>  <p class="mt-4 lg:mt-7.5 text-base text-#2D2D33/80 text-left">Dificuldade para criar fotos de produtos que realmente vendem? O PicWish é o removedor de fundo online ideal! Remova fundo de imagem com precisão e ajuste o tamanho conforme os padrões de marketplaces como Amazon e Shopee. Obtenha iluminação profissional com um clique e use <a href="https://picwish.com/pt/ai-background-generator" class="text-theme underline decoration-theme">fundos com IA</a> para criar imagens realistas que aumentam a conversão.</p> <button slot="button" class="rounded-full text-white hover:-translate-y-1  shadow-[0_10px_21px_0_rgba(176,204,255,1)] bg-gradient-to-r from-theme via-[#5ea9f9] to-theme bg-[length:200%_100%] bg-[position:100%_0] hover:bg-[position:0_0] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mt-10 lg:block hidden">  <div class="py-14px px-16 text-18px font-600 upload-btn" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> <span data-astro-cid-3is2dfml="">Remover fundo agora</span> <svg class="inline-block ml-2" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml="true"><path stroke="#fff" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m12 8-8 7M4 1l3.238 2.835"></path></svg> </div>  </button> </div> <div class="lg:w-60% w-full">   <div class="relative lg:flex hidden w-full" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> <img src="./carrinho_files/feature-img-1.DqtOs2eS.png" width="700" height="390" class="rounded-8 shadow-[0px_30px_60px_0px_rgba(43,43,135,0.15)]" alt="crie fundo transparente para produto e depois aplique fundo branco" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> </div> <div class="relative lg:hidden flex flex-col justify-center items-center mb-5" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> <img src="./carrinho_files/mobile-feature-1-img.B_8Ey2Un.png" class="mx-auto mt-5" alt="crie fundo transparente para produto e depois aplique fundo branco" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> </div>  </div> </div> <div class="flex justify-center items-center max-w-full lg:max-w-300 w-full lg:flex-row justify-between flex-col lg:mt-50 mt-5 content-wrapper"> <div class="lg:w-40% w-full md:text-left text-center  lg:max-w-105"> <h3 class="font-600! lg:text-7 lg:leading-normal text-2xl">Economize tempo com <span class="text-theme">Removedor de Fundo Grátis</span></h3>  <p class="mt-4 lg:mt-7.5 text-base text-#2D2D33/80 text-left">Agora qualquer pessoa pode remover fundo de imagem online grátis sem conhecimentos técnicos. O PicWish oferece resultados profissionais em segundos, com poucos cliques. Deixe o fundo transparente facilmente, inclusive pelo celular. Sem instalar nada — tudo direto no navegador.</p> <button slot="button" class="rounded-full text-white hover:-translate-y-1  shadow-[0_10px_21px_0_rgba(176,204,255,1)] bg-gradient-to-r from-theme via-[#5ea9f9] to-theme bg-[length:200%_100%] bg-[position:100%_0] hover:bg-[position:0_0] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mt-10 lg:block hidden">  <div class="py-14px px-16 text-18px font-600 upload-btn" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml=""> <span data-astro-cid-3is2dfml="">Remover fundo agora</span> <svg class="inline-block ml-2" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" data-astro-cid-3is2dfml="true"><path stroke="#fff" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m12 8-8