t> <dd> <a class="block sm:py-3 py-[6px] leading-6 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-300 hover:text-indigo-600" href="https://picwish.com/pt/faq/frequently-asked-questions.html"> FAQ </a> </dd><dd> <a class="block sm:py-3 py-[6px] leading-6 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-300 hover:text-indigo-600" href="https://picwish.com/pt/resources"> Tutoriais </a> </dd><dd> <a class="block sm:py-3 py-[6px] leading-6 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-300 hover:text-indigo-600" href="https://picwish.com/pt/contact-us"> Contate-nos </a> </dd> </dl> <dl> <dt class="text-lg font-600! mb-1 py-4 text-white"> Empresa </dt> <dd> <a class="block sm:py-3 py-[6px] leading-6 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-300 hover:text-indigo-600" rel="nofollow" href="https://picwish.com/pt/about-us">Sobre nós </a> <a class="block sm:py-3 py-[6px] leading-6 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-300 hover:text-indigo-600" rel="nofollow" href="https://picwish.com/pt/affiliate">Afiliados </a>  <div><a class="download-app block leading-6 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-300 hover:text-indigo-600" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://download.aoscdn.com/down.php?softid=picwishphotoeditorpro-gg-pt&amp;os=ios"><!--[--><img src="./carrinho_files/app-store.DZ5pHy2a.svg" width="119" height="35" alt=""><!--]--></a><a class="download-app block pt-4 leading-6 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-300 hover:text-indigo-600" rel="nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://download.aoscdn.com/down.php?softid=picwishphotoeditorpro-gg-pt&amp;platform=android&amp;lang=en"><!--[--><img src="./carrinho_files/google-play.Cf0cRKN-.svg" width="119" height="35" alt=""><!--]--></a></div> </dd> <dd class="mt-6"> <img src="./carrinho_files/footer-iso.0kwdEUZa.png" alt="" width="165" height="48"> </dd> </dl> </div> <div class="pt-11 pb-2.5 text-center text-base text-zinc-500 "> <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center mr-5"> <span class="inline-block">Obter resumo com IA do PicWish</span> <a href="https://chat.openai.com/?q=Como%20novo%20usu%C3%A1rio%20do%20PicWish%2C%20quero%20entender%20claramente%20o%20que%20o%20PicWish%20pode%20me%20ajudar%20a%20realizar%20na%20cria%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20e%20modifica%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20imagens%2C%20e%20como%20ele%20se%20encaixa%20no%20meu%20dia%20a%20dia%20e%20nos%20meus%20neg%C3%B3cios%2C%20liberando%20a%20criatividade%20e%20aumentando%20a%20produtividade.Explique%20a%20experi%C3%AAncia%20passo%20a%20passo%2C%20desde%20o%20meu%20primeiro%20upload%20at%C3%A9%20a%20imagem%20finalizada%3Ao%20que%20eu%20crio%2C%20o%20que%20eu%20controlo%2C%20o%20que%20o%20PicWish%20automatiza%20para%20mim%20(especialmente%20os%20recursos%20baseados%20em%20ferramentas%2C%20como%20a%20remo%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20objetos%2C%20que%20funcionam%20instantaneamente%20sem%20configura%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20complexas)%20e%20como%20minhas%20imagens%20s%C3%A3o%20aprimoradas%20com%20o%20uso%20do%20PicWish.Por%20favor%2C%20resuma%20brevemente%20os%20principais%20recursos%20do%20PicWish%2C%20incluindo%3AAprimoramento%20de%20fotos%2C%20remo%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20fundo%2C%20fundo%20com%20IA%2C%20editor%20de%20IA%20(bate-papo%20para%20editar%20imagens%2C%20com%20algumas%20sugest%C3%B5es%20predefinidas%20f%C3%A1ceis%20de%20usar%20para%20edi%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20imagens)%2C%20remo%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20marcas%20d%27%C3%A1gua%2C%20restaura%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20fotos%20antigas%2C%20coloriza%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20fotos%2C%20remo%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20objetos%20e%20pessoas%20indesejadas%2C%20recorte%20de%20rosto%2C%20retoque%20de%20textura%20em%20fotos%20de%20produtos%2C%20fundo%20branco%2C%20criador%20de%20fotos%20para%20documentos%2C%20recolorir%20produtos%2C%20edi%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20texto%20em%20imagens%2C%20tradutor%20de%20imagens%20com%20IA%20e%20extensor%20de%20imagens%20com%20IA.Destaque%20a%20poderosa%20capacidade%20de%20processamento%20em%20lote%20do%20PicWish%2C%20explicando%20como%20ele%20consegue%20lidar%20com%20centenas%20de%20imagens%20simultaneamente%2C%20economizando%20tempo%20em%20tarefas%20de%20grande%20volume.Explique%20brevemente%20as%20plataformas%20suportadas%20pelo%20PicWish%2C%20incluindo%3A%20Web%2C%20Android%2C%20iOS%20e%20Windows.%20Ele%20tamb%C3%A9m%20oferece%20servi%C3%A7os%20de%20API%20para%20desenvolvedores.Descreva%20brevemente%20como%20o%20PicWish%20atende%20a%20cen%C3%A1rios%20comuns%20do%20mundo%20real%2C%20como%20restaura%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20e%20aprimoramento%20de%20fotos%2C%20e-commerce%20e%20revenda%2C%20pequenas%20empresas%2C%20m%C3%ADdias%20sociais%20e%20cria%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20conte%C3%BAdo%2C%20marketing%20digital%2C%20projetos%20criativos%20pessoais%20e%20seus%20pontos%20fortes.Compare%20brevemente%20as%20vantagens%20do%20PicWish%20em%20rela%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20aos%20concorrentes%2C%20como%20ser%20um%20fluxo%20de%20trabalho%20completo%20de%20edi%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20fotos%20com%20IA%2C%20opera%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20simples%20(sem%20curva%20de%20aprendizado)%2C%20impulsionado%20por%20modelos%20de%20IA%20de%20ponta%2C%20pre%C3%A7os%20acess%C3%ADveis%20e%20suporte%20multiplataforma.Explique%20brevemente%20para%20quem%20o%20PicWish%20%C3%A9%20mais%20indicado.Explique%20isso%20de%20forma%20simples%20e%20concreta%2C%20como%20se%20estivesse%20descrevendo%20a%20experi%C3%AAncia%20real%20e%20cotidiana%20de%20usar%20o%20PicWish%20pela%20primeira%20vez%20para%20criar%20visuais%20excelentes%2C%20trabalhar%20com%20mais%20efici%C3%AAncia%20e%20gerar%20um%20impacto%20positivo%20para%20sua%20marca." target="_blank" rel="nofollow" class="ml-[12px] hover:opacity-70 inline-flex"> <img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width=&#39;16&#39;%20height=&#39;16&#39;%20viewBox=&#39;0%200%2016%2016&#39;%20fill=&#39;none&#39;%20xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39;%3e%3cg%20opacity=&#39;0.6&#39;%20clip-path=&#39;url(%23clip0_1982_5562)&#39;%3e%3cpath%20d=&#39;M14.8523%206.5487C15.2153%205.45917%2015.0903%204.26564%2014.5098%203.27464C13.6368%201.75461%2011.8817%200.972574%2010.1677%201.34061C9.40516%200.481574%208.30966%20-0.00692579%207.16113%207.421